 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yXVr__3LGZcQ7kNvwE7Itx4&_nc_oc=AdqsdFOLKrf_8vYXJq-3BIzb_ST1TRJosZRFZyWCvQ6rheHbxIHtjLTaS69KmGKxva8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG3G2EI2COThOJb2EEXmMXii7SvV0vbUSxo9H9v-04EMg&oe=6A86E281"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c71qgxvezlkQ7kNvwFkmii9&_nc_oc=AdpMKePuEPolqm65qKi6uh0xLYkrYjUfrEDPsNZyrW63vwkl5QCiXyDE6abbaw0emXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE6nf6f8uIttytqQqEr6LHfbSA9t4PV82LhepOvXRvoWQ&oe=6A86EFE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z-drlBrGN4QQ7kNvwGyH4CV&_nc_oc=Ados5SieM9qiNCm8DShgQ-kAQa5cycpmZh6E45XcApWgPKvGpMUZmwOQLnJuOIKNuE8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEtSG2lvaHXgkv5uST6iYgdbzNQSLRaScClc19qWnUINw&oe=6A86F9DC"}, {"fil